        "v": 11,
        "title": "Stream recovery telemetry allowlisted and streak API gains last Source",
        "summary": "common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts adds the `stream_recovery` event to its Axiam-only allowlist via a new `STREAM_RECOVERY_FIELDS` schema, and `getAxiomOnlyLogEvent` now branches on both `context_pruning.completed` and `stream_recovery` using exact equality plus a shared `sanitizeAllowlistedFields` helper that drops unknown keys and mismatched types. packages/agent-runtime/src/tools/stream-parser.ts replaces `countTrailingStreamRecoveryNotes` with `trailingStreamRecoveryStreak` (returning `count` and `lastSource`), swaps the `RECOVERY_TAGS` array for a `SOURCE_BY_RECOVERY_TAG` Map to avoid prototype-chain lookups, and emits `axiomEvent: STREAM_RECOVERY_EVENT` on both the gave-up error log and the rescued info log. sdk/src/impl/llm.ts logs one `stream_recovery_detected` event per occurrence with the allowlisted `axiomEvent` marker so the metadata ships to Axiom as real values.",
        "significance": "major",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts adds `STREAM_RECOVERY_EVENT` and `STREAM_RECOVERY_FIELDS`, refactors `getAxiomOnlyLogEvent` to branch on both events via exact equality and `sanitizeAllowlistedFields`; packages/agent-runtime/src/tools/stream-parser.ts replaces `countTrailingStreamRecoveryNotes` with `trailingStreamRecoveryStreak` (returning `count` and `lastSource`), swaps `RECOVERY_TAGS` for a `SOURCE_BY_RECOVERY_TAG` Map, imports `STREAM_RECOVERY_EVENT`, and tags recovery logs with `axiomEvent`; sdk/src/impl/llm.ts imports `STREAM_RECOVERY_EVENT` and adds `axiomEvent` to the `stream_recovery_detected` warn payload.",
        "userVisible": false,
        "confidence": "high",
        "unknowns": "The change wires up the allowance and streak helpers but does not itself alter retry counts or message logic visible to end-users.",
        "changes": [
