            "what": "Adds the `STREAM_RECOVERY_EVENT` constant and `STREAM_RECOVERY_FIELDS` allowlist, then refactors `getAxiomOnlyLogEvent` to dispatch on both event names using exact equality and a shared `sanitizeAllowlistedFields` that enforces type and string-length constraints.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts"
