        "summary": "Adds `FREEBUFF_CROF_GLM_V52_MODEL_ID` (`crof/glm-5.2`) and `base2-free-glm-crof` agent to `freebuff-models.ts` and `free-agents.ts`. This god-mode-only route isolates CrofAI testing from the standard Fireworks referral path. Scope includes `SUPPORTED_FREEBUFF_MODELS`, `FREEBUFF_WEB_GOD_ONLY_MODELS`, and `FREEBUFF_WEB_PREMIUM_MODEL_IDS` allowlists. The internal wire ID maps to native `glm-5.2` on CrofAI, marked `experimental: true`.",
